    "content": "<p>You are given an integer <code>timer</code> representing the remaining time (in seconds) on a traffic signal.</p>\n\n<p>The signal follows these rules:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>If <code>timer == 0</code>, the signal is <code>&quot;Green&quot;</code></li>\n\t<li>If <code>timer == 30</code>, the signal is <code>&quot;Orange&quot;</code></li>\n\t<li>If <code>30 &lt; timer &lt;= 90</code>, the signal is <code>&quot;Red&quot;</code></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Return the current state of the signal. If none of the above conditions are met, return <code>&quot;Invalid&quot;</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">timer = 60</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;Red&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Since <code>timer = 60</code>, and <code>30 &lt; timer &lt;= 90</code>, the answer is <code>&quot;Red&quot;</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">timer = 5</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;Invalid&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Since <code>timer = 5</code>, it does not satisfy any of the given conditions, the answer is <code>&quot;Invalid&quot;</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= timer &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>\n",
